words": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dD0L6cPkEV4Q7kNvwHLC0V7&_nc_oc=Admo5KK524n9eS7uLsuXIYkTe-FBqGWdR7mmSUcuzD-yS68fEfsPDU-yEME7ZrPXUy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyC683cNiTOXL162s1l-tQMGiMKQ3HI_9YcyZ2UUS3p_A&oe=69AECA41"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tK9VuaL9YGAQ7kNvwG09yrc&_nc_oc=AdlZAtcvFJ6qUGKq4wtbzENPaP_WGPqedT2NU6Vj_igkiiFzEpDrJbiLb3MEjhBH014&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy6AH14HgLlA9aLPE5VItLbTnKL85SlpaddJRw4oH0cOQ&oe=69AEBEB3"}, {"file_name": "Cover-Square.png", "id": "811623013181900", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974629_811623016515233_3126397619395326849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zLV5PRJ_WrkQ7kNvwGkZ336&_nc_oc=AdlShcIi0yHzk7jWjeYxeBqlGaAlpRUBlLBHtKhQMXEjHkVeWMh96Txd